==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Diabrollow]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Zollow]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[The Perfect Cyclone]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*5 [[Duche]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A pretty simple stage. [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]], [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] together can deal with the peons here. [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] and [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] will be the main units to invade into The Perfect Cyclone's personal space. Thanks to Diabrollows, your Bullet Trains can get repeatedly knockedback to gain extra value.
[[Ototo Corps#Thunderbolt|Thunderbolt Cannon]] is recommended for  when Duche or Zollow come close, allowing for easier elimination of the main threats.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Talents|Talented]] [[Cat Clan Heroes (Uber Rare Cat)|Heavenly Cat Heroes]]: Heavenly Cat Heroes can [[Weaken]] The Perfect Cyclone and is immune to Diabrollow's Wave Attacks. Although a little pricey, just getting their [[Dodge Attack|Dodge]] Talent up by a few levels completely facilitates this stage as The Perfect Cyclone's fast attack rate constantly triggers Heavenly Cat Heroes' Dodge. Their [[Immune to Toxic]] Talent is especially recommended. However, if you would not like to use your NP and the hefty cost of a [[Catfruit|Golden Catfruit Seed]] to reach their Ultra Form, there are alternative anti-Floating ubers.
*[[The Grateful Crane (Uber Rare Cat)|Supernova Cosmo]]: Supernova Cosmo stays a far enough range away to not be hit by the Diabrollows, and his Knockback and Waves heavily cripple The Perfect Cyclone and its peons.
*[[Tekachi (Uber Rare Cat)|Adamankachi]]: Does an even better job at tanking the Cyclone than the Heavenly Cat Heroes. Be wary of the Zollows, who will almost always immediately kill it. Even of it does die, however, its recharge rate is quite short.

